    {
     "tag": "P",
     "cls": "auroras-txt aos-init",
     "t": "Unlike traditional SLAM systems that output only sparse point clouds, Aurora S employs built-in deep learning multimodal perception to generate dense, richly textured maps with precise localization. Its semantic recognition engine enhances geometric maps with real-time semantic labeling, ushering spatial navigation into the multimodal perception era—purpose-built for embodied intelligence.",
